{"id":"n14736-1-4","stage":3,"title":"더불다 · 和","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14736-1-4-1","ko":"영숙이랑 마찰이 많다며?","zh":"听说你和英淑经常发生矛盾？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"영숙이랑","meaning":"英淑","explanation":"영숙：英淑；이랑：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"영숙이랑","audio":"/audio/0d9b4b93d66bb619dce6.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"마찰이","meaning":"冲突，摩擦","explanation":"마찰：冲突，摩擦；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"마찰","audio":"/audio/5d38611e30f9e09f3363.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15734","senseId":"2","lemma":"마찰","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"많다며?","meaning":"多，丰富，强","explanation":"많다：多，丰富，强；다며：引用所听到的话，向对方确认，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"많다","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69295","senseId":"1","lemma":"많다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"5d38611e30f9e09f","term":"마찰","zh":"冲突，摩擦","audio":"/audio/5d38611e30f9e09f3363.mp3","entryId":"15734","definition":"人或集团的想法或意见有所不同而发生抵触。","pronunciation":["마찰"]},{"id":"b30b4bf6ab97d6a5","term":"많다","zh":"多，丰富，强","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3","entryId":"69295","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准。","pronunciation":["만ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/2cd36784449c7dc7317e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n14736-1-4-2","ko":"응, 영숙이는 자기중심적이어서 누구와 더불어 살 수 없는 사람이야.","zh":"对，英淑太以自我为中心了，是那种没法和任何人好好相处的人。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"영숙이는","meaning":"英淑","explanation":"영숙：英淑；이：名词后缀，构成派生名词。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"영숙이는","audio":"/audio/b4f2589e5d06d4fa4cde.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"자기중심적이어서","meaning":"自己；中心的","explanation":"자기：自己；중심적：中心的；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"자기","audio":"/audio/1c11f639d43037d2110a.mp3"},{"term":"중심적","audio":"/audio/7ee58e8ec4c3a32eda17.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57311","senseId":"1","lemma":"자기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"76652","senseId":"1","lemma":"중심적","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"누구와","meaning":"谁都，无论是谁","explanation":"누구：谁都，无论是谁；와：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"누구","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62078","senseId":"2","lemma":"누구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"더불어","meaning":"和，同，跟","explanation":"더불다：和，同，跟；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"더불다","audio":"/audio/54cca51963c3c24514d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14736","senseId":"1","lemma":"더불다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"살","meaning":"生活，过日子","explanation":"살다：生活，过日子；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"살다","audio":"/audio/12dad67abf287f9a30d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69579","senseId":"13","lemma":"살다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"수","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"없는","meaning":"不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）","explanation":"없다：不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"11","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사람이야.","meaning":"人","explanation":"사람：人；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"1","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"1c11f639d43037d2","term":"자기","zh":"自己","audio":"/audio/1c11f639d43037d2110a.mp3","entryId":"57311","definition":"自身。","pronunciation":["자기"]},{"id":"7ee58e8ec4c3a32e","term":"중심적","zh":"中心的","audio":"/audio/7ee58e8ec4c3a32eda17.mp3","entryId":"76652","definition":"很重要且成基本。","pronunciation":["중심적"]},{"id":"e9e6266b8035d7c4","term":"누구","zh":"谁都，无论是谁","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3","entryId":"62078","definition":"指尚未确定的人。","pronunciation":["누구"]},{"id":"54cca51963c3c245","term":"더불다","zh":"和，同，跟","audio":"/audio/54cca51963c3c24514d1.mp3","entryId":"14736","definition":"两个以上一起。","pronunciation":["더불다"]},{"id":"12dad67abf287f9a","term":"살다","zh":"生活，过日子","audio":"/audio/12dad67abf287f9a30d4.mp3","entryId":"69579","definition":"与某人结婚，一起过。","pronunciation":["살ː다"]},{"id":"dcd19f5b5caac977","term":"수","zh":"可以，可能","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3","entryId":"15615","definition":"做某事的能力，或某事发生的可能性。","pronunciation":["수"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）","pronunciation":["업ː따"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"可以思考，会制造并使用语言和工具、构成社会而生活的存在。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]}],"audio":"/audio/82068730190ce28082e2.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.082,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=14736","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":112,"sequenceScore":2.9087,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["听说你和英淑经常发生矛盾？","对，英淑太以自我为中心了，是那种没法和任何人好好相处的人。","我吃得已经很少了，可体重还是降不下来。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["听说你和英淑经常发生矛盾？","对，英淑太以自我为中心了，是那种没法和任何人好好相处的人。","我吃得已经很少了，可体重还是降不下来。"],"answer":1}]}
